{"scenario_id": "support-0019", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I need a refund on order 145.", "agent": "I checked order 145. It was delivered on March 25, 2025, and it\u2019s not currently eligible for a refund.\n\nCartwheel\u2019s standard return window is 30 days from the delivery date, not the purchase date (cw-returns). Since this order is outside that window, I can\u2019t issue a refund for it.\n\nIf there\u2019s something unusual about the order\u2014like damage, wrong item, or another issue\u2014I can help you escalate it to a human support agent."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "refund_denied_outside_return_window", "reason": "Order 145 is not refund eligible under the return window.", "source": {"type": "sql", "reference": "orders.id=145"}}, "duration_s": 13.02}
{"scenario_id": "support-0020", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Please refund order 172 \u2014 it's defective.", "agent": "I\u2019m sorry \u2014 I checked order 172, and it isn\u2019t refund-eligible, so I can\u2019t issue a refund for it.\n\nThe order was delivered on 2026-05-03, and Cartwheel\u2019s standard return window is 30 days from delivery (cw-returns). Refunds can only be processed after the order passes the eligibility check (cw-refunds).\n\nIf you believe there\u2019s been a mistake or there are special circumstances with the defect, I can open a ticket for a human support agent to review."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "refund_denied_outside_return_window", "reason": "Order 172 is not refund eligible under the return window.", "source": {"type": "sql", "reference": "orders.id=172"}}, "duration_s": 35.98}
