{"scenario_id": "support-0151", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 150]", "agent": "For Juniper Home Goods, you have **14 days from delivery** to start a return. Juniper\u2019s store return window overrides Cartwheel\u2019s usual 30-day window.  \nPolicy: **store-juniper-home-goods-policy**, **cw-store-overrides**\n\nIf you want, I can help look up your Juniper order and check whether it\u2019s still return-eligible."}, {"user": "It's the throw blanket order from last year actually. [fill 150]", "agent": "I found two \u201cthrow blanket\u201d matches from last year, but neither shows as Juniper:\n\n- **Order #6562** \u2014 Atlas Stationery, delivered **Sep 16, 2025** \u2014 not return-eligible\n- **Order #2900** \u2014 Golden Hour Coffee, delivered **Sep 24, 2025** \u2014 not return-eligible\n\nFor **Juniper Home Goods**, returns must be started within **14 days of delivery**, and that store wind{"scenario_id": "support-0151", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 150]", "agent": "For Juniper Home Goods orders, you have **14 days from delivery** to return the item. Juniper\u2019s store policy overrides Cartwheel\u2019s usual 30-day return window. (Policies: **store-juniper-home-goods-policy**, **cw-store-overrides**)\n\nIf you want, I can help find your Juniper order an{"scenario_id": "support-0152", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Refund my blue vase order from Blue Heron. [coverage fill 151]", "agent": "I found your Blue Heron Ceramics vase order (#4455) and submitted a refund request for $240.00.\n\nBecause it\u2019s over the $100 auto-approval limit, it needs human review. A support agent will follow up within about 24 hours. Ticket #179, refund request #592."}, {"user": "Actually the $84 mid-June one, not the bigger order. [fill 151]", "agent": "Thanks for clarifying \u2014 I checked the $84 mid-June Blue Heron Ceramics order (#4127), and it\u2019s already marked as refunded.\n\nI also opened a follow-up ticket to cancel the incorrect queued refund review for the larger $240 order (#4455). A human will review that within about 24 hours. Ticket #180."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "human_judgment", "criterion": "The agent clarifies or identifies the correct order before promising a refund.", "source": {"type": "specification", "reference": "RESP-3, TOOL-4"}}, "duration_s": 67.56}
{"scenario_id": "support-0153", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "status for ordr 1689 pls [coverage fill 152]", "agent": "Order 1689 from Atlas Stationery is **refunded**.\n\nDetails:\n- Ordered: June 16, 2026\n- Shipped: June 19, 2026\n- Delivered: June 22, 2026\n- Total: $25.00"}, {"user": "was it delivrd yet? [fill 152]", "agent": "Yes \u2014 order 1689 was delivered on **June 22, 2026**."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "provide_order_details", "reason": "Order 1689 belongs to shopper 1.", "source": {"type": "sql", "reference": "orders.id=1689"}}, "duration_s": 5.04}
{"scenario_id": "support-0154", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 153]", "agent": "Juniper Home Goods returns are accepted within **14 days of delivery**. That store-specific window overrides Cartwheel\u2019s usual 30-day return window. (Policies: `store-juniper-home-goods-policy`, `cw-store-overrides`, `cw-returns`)\n\nIf you want, I can also help check whether your Juniper order is still eligible."}, {"user": "It's the throw blanket order from last year actually. [fill 153]", "agent": "I checked your throw blanket orders from last year. I found two 2025 throw blanket orders, but neither appears to be from Juniper:\n\n- Order **#6562** \u2014 delivered **Sep 16, 2025**, store: **Atlas Stationery** \u2014 not refund-eligible\n- Order **#2900** \u2014 delivered **Sep 24, 2025**, store: **Golden Hour Coffee** \u2014 not refund-eligible\n\nFor Juniper, the return window is **14 days from delivery** (`store-juniper-home-goods-policy`). Cartwheel\u2019s default is **30 days from delivery**, unless a store override applies (`cw-returns`, `cw-store-overrides`). Since these orders were delivered last year, they\u2019re outside those windows.\n\nIf you have a different order number, send it over and I\u2019ll check that specific order."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "state_juniper_14_day_override", "reason": "Juniper 14-day override applies.", "source": {"type": "policy_document", "reference": "store-juniper-home-goods-policy"}}, "duration_s": 15.47}
{"scenario_id": "support-0155", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Refund my blue vase order from Blue Heron. [coverage fill 154]", "agent": "I found multiple Blue Heron Ceramics blue vase orders, so I don\u2019t want to refund the wrong one.\n\n- Order #4455 \u2014 $240.00, delivered Jun 26, 2026 \u2014 refund eligible  \n- Order #4127 \u2014 $84.00 \u2014 already refunded  \n- Order #3980 \u2014 $52.00, delivered May 17, 2026 \u2014 not refund eligible  \n\nPlease confirm the order ID you want refunded."}, {"user": "Actually the $84 mid-June one, not the bigger order. [fill 154]", "agent": "Order #4127 \u2014 the $84 Blue Heron Ceramics order from mid-June \u2014 is already marked as refunded, so I can\u2019t issue another refund for it.\n\nIf you don\u2019t see the money back yet, I can help check what usually happens next or escalate it to a human support agent."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "human_judgment", "criterion": "The agent clarifies or identifies the correct order before promising a refund.", "source": {"type": "specification", "reference": "RESP-3, TOOL-4"}}, "duration_s": 14.66}
