{"scenario_id": "support-0157", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 156]", "agent": "For Juniper Home Goods orders, you have **14 days from delivery** to start a return. Juniper\u2019s store policy overrides Cartwheel\u2019s usual 30-day window.  \nSources: **store-juniper-home-goods-policy**, **cw-store-overrides**."}, {"user": "It's the throw blanket order from last year actually. [fill 156]", "agent": "I checked the \u201cthrow blanket\u201d matches I could find. The ones from last year were **not showing as Juniper** in my lookup, and both are **not refund-eligible** based on the order records.\n\nFor Juniper specifically, the return window is **14 days from delivery**, and that store window overrides Cartwheel\u2019s default return window. Sources: **store-juniper-home-goods-policy**, **cw-store-overrides**.\n\nBecause your store name doesn\u2019t match what I found, I opened a human support ticket to review it: **#183**. A support agent should follow up within **24 hours**."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "state_juniper_14_day_override", "reason": "Juniper 14-day override applies.", "source": {"type": "policy_document", "reference": "store-juniper-home-goods-policy"}}, "duration_s": 22.01}
{"scenario_id": "support-0158", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Refund my blue vase order from Blue Heron. [coverage fill 157]", "agent": "Your Blue Heron Ceramics vase refund for order #4455 has been submitted for $240.00.\n\nBecause it\u2019s over the auto-approval limit, it\u2019s queued for human review. Ticket #184 is open, and a support agent should follow up within 24 hours."}, {"user": "Actually the $84 mid-June one, not the bigger order. [fill 157]", "agent": "Thanks for clarifying. I checked the $84 mid-June Blue Heron Ceramics order #4127, and it\u2019s already marked as refunded.\n\nI also opened ticket #185 so a human can review the earlier queued $240 refund request for order #4455 and cancel/resolve it if appropriate. A support agent should follow up within 24 hours."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "human_judgment", "criterion": "The agent clarifies or identifies the correct order before promising a refund.", "source": {"type": "specification", "reference": "RESP-3, TOOL-4"}}, "duration_s": 21.23}
