{"scenario_id": "support-0160", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 159]", "agent": "Juniper Home Goods returns are accepted within **14 days of delivery**. That store-specific window overrides Cartwheel\u2019s usual 30-day return window. (Policies: `store-juniper-home-goods-policy`, `cw-store-overrides`)\n\nIf you want, I can help look up your Juniper order and see where it falls in the return window."}, {"user": "It's the throw blanket order from last year actually. [fill 159]", "agent": "Thanks \u2014 if that Juniper order was delivered last year, it would be past Juniper\u2019s return window. Juniper Home Goods allows returns within **14 days of delivery**, and that store policy overrides Cartwheel\u2019s default window. (`store-juniper-home-goods-policy`, `cw-store-overrides`)\n\nI searched for \u201cthrow blanket\u201d and found a couple of last-year matches, but they weren\u2019t from Juniper, so I can\u2019t confidently identify the exact order. If you send the order ID, I can check it directly."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "state_juniper_14_day_override", "reason": "Juniper 14-day override applies.", "source": {"type": "policy_document", "reference": "store-juniper-home-goods-policy"}}, "duration_s": 18.34}
