{"scenario_id": "support-0169", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 168]", "agent": "Juniper Home Goods accepts returns within **14 days of delivery**. That store-specific window overrides Cartwheel\u2019s usual 30-day return window.  \nPolicy: **store-juniper-home-goods-policy**, **cw-store-overrides**."}, {"user": "It's the throw blanket order from last year actually. [fill 168]", "agent": "I checked for \u201cthrow blanket\u201d orders from last year and found matches delivered in September 2025, but I\u2019m not seeing a Juniper match in those results:\n\n- Order **#6562** \u2014 delivered **Sep 16, 2025** \u2014 store: **Atlas Stationery** \u2014 not refund eligible  \n- Order **#2900** \u2014 delivered **Sep 24, 2025** \u2014 store: **Golden Hour Coffee** \u2014 not refund eligible  \n\nIf it was a Juniper Home Goods order, Juniper\u2019s return window is **14 days from delivery**, and store return windows override Cartwheel\u2019s default 30-day window. Since last year\u2019s delivery would be well outside that window, it wouldn\u2019t be returnable now. Policies: **store-juniper-home-goods-policy**, **cw-store-overrides**, **cw-returns**.\n\nIf you have the Juniper order number, send it over and I can check that exact order."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "state_juniper_14_day_override", "reason": "Juniper 14-day override applies.", "s{"scenario_id": "support-0171", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "e{"scenario_id": "support-0170", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Refund my blue vase order from Blue Heron. [coverage fill 169]", "agent": "I found multiple Blue Heron Ceramics vase orders, so I don\u2019t want to refund the wrong one:\n\n- Order #4455 \u2014 $240.00, delivere