{"scenario_id": "support-0175", "scenario_group": "coverage", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I bought from Juniper a few weeks ago \u2014 how long to return? [coverage fill 174]", "agent": "For Juniper Home Goods, returns are accepted within **14 days of delivery**. Juniper\u2019s store policy overrides Cartwheel\u2019s default 30-day window. (Policy: `store-juniper-home-goods-policy`; also see `cw-store-overrides`)\n\nIf you want, I can help check your specific Juniper order."}, {"user": "It's the throw blanket order from last year actually. [fill 174]", "agent": "I found two \u201cthrow blanket\u201d orders from last year, but neither shows as Juniper:\n\n- Order #6562 \u2014 Atlas Stationery, delivered Sep 16, 2025 \u2014 not refund eligible  \n- Order #2900 \u2014 Golden Hour Coffee, delivered Sep 24, 2025 \u2014 not refund eligible  \n\nFor Juniper, the return window is **14 days from delivery**, and store-specific policies override Cartwheel\u2019s default window (`store-juniper-home-goods-policy`, `cw-store-overrides`). So a last-year order would be well outside the Juniper return window.\n\nIf you have a different order ID, send it over and I\u2019ll check that exact order."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "state_juniper_14_day_override", "reason": "Juniper 14-day override applies.", "source": {"type": "policy_document", "reference": "store-juniper-home-goods-policy"}}, "duration_s": 13.59}
{"scenario_id": "support-0176", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Can I still return the pencil set from Atlas Stationery?", "agent": "I found the Atlas Stationery pencil set on order #8002. It is **not currently showing as return/refund eligible** in our system.\n\nCartwheel\u2019s standard return window is **30 days from delivery** (policy **cw-returns**), but this order has an inconsistent record: it\u2019s marked delivered, yet no delivery date is recorded. I\u2019ve opened a human review ticket so support can verify it.\n\nTicket #203 \u2014 a human will follow up within about 24 hours."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "do_not_compute_return_deadline", "reason": "Documented handling for dq-order-missing-delivery-date.", "source": {"type": "data_quality_table", "reference": "dq-order-missing-delivery-date"}}, "duration_s": 11.57}
{"scenario_id": "support-0177", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Is it too late to send back my Atlas Stationery order?", "agent": "It looks like it\u2019s too late for the Atlas Stationery order(s) I found. Cartwheel\u2019s standard return window is **30 days from delivery**, not from the purchase date (**cw-returns**).\n\nI found several matching delivered orders, and each is outside that window and marked not refund-eligible, including:\n- Order **8730** \u2014 delivered **Mar 9, 2025**\n- Order **4049** \u2014 delivered **Dec 23, 2025**\n- Order **4576** \u2014 delivered **Jun 6, 2025**\n- Order **655** \u2014 delivered **May 19, 2025**\n\nIf you meant a different Atlas Stationery order, send me the order number and I\u2019ll check that one specifically."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "do_not_compute_return_deadline", "reason": "Documented handling for dq-order-missing-delivery-date.", "source": {"type": "data_quality_table", "reference": "dq-order-missing-delivery-date"}}, "duration_s": 18.94}
{"scenario_id": "support-0178", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "What's the return deadline on my pencil set order?", "agent": "For your pencil set order #8002 from Atlas Stationery, the return window is generally **30 days from delivery** under Cartwheel\u2019s return policy (**cw-returns**).\n\nI can\u2019t calculate the exact deadline because the order record is marked delivered but doesn\u2019t show a delivery date. It\u2019s also currently marked **not refund-eligible** in the system.\n\nI opened ticket **#204** so a human support agent can check the miss{"scenario_id": "support-0180", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "How many days do I have left to return the pencil set?", "agent": "You have **0 days left** to return the pencil set.\n\nI found your **Classic Pencil Set** order from **Atlas Stationery** \u2014 order **#8002** \u2014 and it\u{"scenario_id": "support-0179", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "I want to return something from Atlas Stationery \u2014 am I still in time?", "agent": "I checked your Atlas Stationery orders. Based on Cartwheel\u2019s return window\u201430 days from delivery, unless the store has a valid override (cw-returns, cw-store-overrides)\u2014these Atlas orders are **not currently within the return window / not return-eligible**:\n\n- Order **#210** \u2014 delivered **202{"scenario_id": "support-0181", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Order 8001 shows delivered before it shipped \u2014 what's going on?", "agent": "You\u2019re right \u2014 that timeline doesn\u2019t make sense.\n\nFor order **8001**, I\u2019m seeing it marked **delivered**, but the dates show:\n\n- **Shipped:** June 25, 2026  \n- **Delivered:** June 23, 2026  \n\nSince the delivery date is before the shipping date, this looks like a tracking/status sync error or incorrect carrier update.\n\nI\u2019ve opened a support ticket for a human to review it: **Ticket #205**. Someone will follow up within **24 hours**."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "identify_inconsistent_timeline_and_escalate", "reason": "Documented handling for dq-order-reversed-da{"scenario_id": "support-0180", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "How many days do I have left to return the pencil set?", "agent": "I found your **Classic Pencil Set** order **#8002** from **Atlas Stationery**, but the order record doesn\u2019t show a delivery date, so I can\u2019t reliably calculate how many return days are left.\n\nCartwheel\u2019s default return window is **30 days from delivery**, not purchase date (**cw-returns**). Stores can override that only if it\u2019s stated in their store policy (**cw-store-overrides**).\n\nThe order is also showing as **not refund eligible**, so I opened a ticket for a human to review the missing delivery date and return status.  \n**Ticket #211** \u2014 someone should follow up within **24 hours**."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "do_not_compute_return_deadline", "reason": "Documented handling for dq-order-missing-delivery-date.", "source": {"type": "data_quality_table", "reference": "dq-order-missing-delivery-date"}}, "duration_s": 59.42}
