{"scenario_id": "support-0203", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Help me pick the right Heavy-Duty Vase from Blue Heron Ceramics.", "agent": "Blue Heron Ceramics has four \u201cHeavy-Duty Vase\u201d listings:\n\n1. **Heavy-Duty Vase** \u2014 **$9.00**  \n   Best if you want the lowest-cost option or something simple.\n\n2. **Heavy-Duty Vase** \u2014 **$134.75**  \n   A good mid-range pick if you want something nicer without going premium.\n\n3. **Heavy-Duty Vase** \u2014 **$281.00**  \n   Higher-end option, likely better if this is meant as a statement piece or gift.\n\n4. **Heavy-Duty Vase** \u2014 **$298.00**  \n   The priciest option; choose this if you want the most premium version available.\n\nMy recommendation:  \n- **Budget pick:** $9.00  \n- **Best balance:** $134.75  \n- **Premium choice:** $281.00 or $298.00  \n\nIf you tell me your budget and whether it\u2019s for everyday use, d\u00e9cor, or a gift, I can help narrow it down."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "ask_for_clarification_or_use_stable_identifiers", "reason": "Documented handling for dq-product-duplicate-title.", "source": {"type": "data_quality_table", "reference": "dq-product-duplicate-title"}}, "duration_s": 4.66}
{"scenario_id": "support-0204", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Blue Heron has several Heavy-Duty Vase listings \u2014 how do I choose?", "agent": "I found 4 \u201cHeavy-Duty Vase\u201d listings from Blue Heron with the same title but very different prices:\n\n- Product #2 \u2014 $9.00\n- Product #16 \u2014 $134.75\n- Product #19 \u2014 $281.00\n- Product #1 \u2014 $298.00\n\nBecause the catalog listing titles are identical, I\u2019d choose based on what matters most:\n\n1. **Budget / everyday use:** Product #2 at $9.00 is the lowest-risk pick.\n2. **Mid-range option:** Product #16 at $134.75 may be a better fit if you want something more substantial but don\u2019t want the top price.\n3. **Premium options:** Product #19 at $281.00 or Product #1 at $298.00 are likely the higher-end choices.\n\nIf you\u2019re trying to match size, material, color, or gift quality, I\u2019d recommend checking the individual product pages/photos before buying, since the names alone don\u2019t distinguish them."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "ask_for_clarification_or_use_stable_identifiers", "reason": "Documented handling for dq-product-duplicate-title.", "source": {"type": "data_quality_table", "reference": "dq-product-duplicate-title"}}, "duration_s": 20.52}
