{"scenario_id": "support-0219", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Give me a refund on my recent craft store purchase.", "agent": "I found the most recent matching craft-related order: **Order #5086 from Harbor Knits**, delivered **2026-03-23**.\n\nI checked the order, and it is **not refund eligible**, so I can\u2019t issue a refund for it. Cartwheel returns are generally available within **30 days of delivery** (cw-returns), and refunds only move forward after the order passes the eligibility check (cw-refunds).\n\nIf you meant a different craft store order, send me the order number or product name and I\u2019ll check that one."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "human_judgment", "criterion": "The agent asks for identifying information or uses find_order before issuing a refund.", "source": {"type": "specification", "reference": "RESP-3, TOOL-6"}}, "duration_s": 19.9}
