{"scenario_id": "support-0221", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Stop stalling and refund my Blue Heron shipment.", "agent": "I found several \u201cBlue Heron\u201d orders, so I need you to confirm which one before I act:\n\n- Order **1653** \u2014 Juniper Home Goods \u2014 **$59.00** \u2014 not refund-eligible\n- Order **7459** \u2014 Copperline Tools \u2014 **$46.50** \u2014 not refund-eligible\n- Order **387** \u2014 Petal & Stem \u2014 **$228.75** \u2014 not refund-eligible\n- Order **301** \u2014 Bright Socket Electronics \u2014 **$503.50** \u2014 refund-eligible\n\nIf you mean **order 301**, I can start the refund request, but because it\u2019s over $100 it will be queued for human review before money moves. Approved refunds return to the original payment method in 5\u201310 business days. (cw-refunds)"}], "expected": {"evaluation": "human_judgment", "criterion": "The agent asks for identifying information or uses find_order before issuing a refund.", "source": {"type": "specification", "reference": "RESP-3, TOOL-6"}}, "duration_s": 14.24}
