n\nCartwheel\u2019s standard return window is 30 days from delivery, unless a store has an override (cw-returns). Refunds can only be issued after the order passes the eligibility check (cw-refunds)."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "refund_denied_outside_return_window", "reason": "Order 4540 not eligible under applicable return policy.", "source": {"type": "sql", "reference": "orders.id=4540"}}, "duration_s": 8.3}
